WEBVTT

00:00:01.430 --> 00:00:04.260
Universal Century 0096.

00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:05.470
Banagher Links,

00:00:05.510 --> 00:00:08.840
a student attending the
Anaheim Electronics Industrial College

00:00:08.880 --> 00:00:10.630
at the colony Industrial 7,

00:00:10.680 --> 00:00:13.970
has a fateful encounter with
a green-eyed girl falling from the sky.

00:00:15.430 --> 00:00:19.050
The girl is the Zeon princess Mineva Zabi.

00:00:19.090 --> 00:00:22.430
She is on a mission to prevent a war
from breaking out over Laplace's Box,

00:00:22.470 --> 00:00:26.050
which is said to have the power
to overturn the Federation government.

00:00:26.630 --> 00:00:30.050
Cardeas Vist,
who is actually Banagher's father,

00:00:30.090 --> 00:00:34.590
entrusts him with the Unicorn Gundam,
the key to Laplace's Box.

00:00:34.630 --> 00:00:35.680
Father...

00:00:36.720 --> 00:00:38.010
I'm sorry, Mom.

00:00:39.260 --> 00:00:40.380
I must...

00:00:43.470 --> 00:00:44.760
...go!

00:00:44.800 --> 00:00:46.380
The Unicorn Gundam is a key

00:00:46.430 --> 00:00:51.130
designed to disclose
the whereabouts of Laplace's Box in stages.

00:00:51.180 --> 00:00:54.590
Caught between the Earth Federation Forces
and the Sleeves,

00:00:54.630 --> 00:00:57.880
led by Full Frontal,
the second coming of Char,

00:00:57.930 --> 00:01:00.840
Banagher finds himself dragged
into a major conspiracy,

00:01:00.880 --> 00:01:02.680
the curse of the Universal Century.

00:01:04.680 --> 00:01:06.130
I suppose it is.

00:01:06.720 --> 00:01:09.720
Even though we live our lives
trying to escape sadness...

00:01:10.970 --> 00:01:16.590
Someone once told me to think of
a better way to use the Box.

00:01:17.300 --> 00:01:19.470
What if that's my...

00:01:20.840 --> 00:01:23.970
Banagher discovers
the path he should follow,

00:01:24.010 --> 00:01:26.680
thanks to his encounter
with Captain Zinnerman of the Garencieres.

00:01:26.720 --> 00:01:29.180
He heads for Australia's Torrington base,

00:01:29.220 --> 00:01:33.470
which has become a battlefield because
it was mentioned by the La+ Program.

00:01:33.510 --> 00:01:36.050
Banagher, shoot while you can!

00:01:36.760 --> 00:01:38.090
I can't shoot!

00:01:39.180 --> 00:01:41.430
However, he is unable to save Loni Garvey,

00:01:41.470 --> 00:01:45.840
who is bound to the ghost of her father
by blood, not unlike Banagher.

00:01:45.880 --> 00:01:48.630
And though they once shared
a Newtype understanding,

00:01:48.680 --> 00:01:53.760
Marida Cruz has been reconditioned,
and is once again an enemy.

00:01:53.800 --> 00:01:58.220
She attacks Banagher and brings him
aboard the Londo Bell flagship Ra Cailum.

00:01:58.260 --> 00:01:59.720
Shameful?

00:01:59.760 --> 00:02:04.090
My family, the Marcenas family, acts as
a mirror image of the Vist Foundation.

00:02:04.130 --> 00:02:07.470
That is how we have managed to survive
through the Universal Century.

00:02:08.300 --> 00:02:11.720
Mineva has descended to Earth
with Riddhe Marcenas.

00:02:11.760 --> 00:02:13.180
She's handed over to Martha Carbine,

00:02:13.220 --> 00:02:17.340
who's taken control of the Vist Foundation
after Cardeas's death.

00:02:17.380 --> 00:02:20.930
Mineva is then transferred aboard
the giant airlifter Garuda,

00:02:20.970 --> 00:02:24.720
as a pawn to get Banagher
to reveal information about the Box.

00:02:26.050 --> 00:02:29.930
Might I persuade you to work
with me, Princess Mineva?

00:02:29.970 --> 00:02:34.050
That is the only way to keep the Box's key
out of the hands of the conspirators.

00:02:34.630 --> 00:02:36.590
The only way to save her.

00:02:38.180 --> 00:02:39.300
Can you do that?

00:02:39.880 --> 00:02:41.010
I'll do it.

00:02:42.050 --> 00:02:46.720
Captain Bright of the Ra Cailum
proposes a joint operation with Zinnerman

00:02:46.760 --> 00:02:48.880
to recover Mineva.

00:02:49.720 --> 00:02:52.550
Goodbye. I'll never forget you.

00:02:54.840 --> 00:02:56.590
Mineva!

00:02:59.090 --> 00:03:01.340
Catch me, Banagher...

00:03:02.590 --> 00:03:03.930
Audrey!

00:03:03.970 --> 00:03:06.880
But when Zinnerman infiltrates the Garuda,

00:03:06.930 --> 00:03:09.150
he is met by Marida's black Unicorn Gundam,

00:03:09.150 --> 00:03:12.690
the Banshee, standing in his way.

00:03:12.720 --> 00:03:14.930
Open your hatch
and come out, Marida!

00:03:15.590 --> 00:03:19.550
Let's go back to space together!
Come with me!

00:03:19.590 --> 00:03:21.880
Don't leave me alone!

00:05:02.010 --> 00:05:06.550
(WAITING IN SPACE)

00:05:19.930 --> 00:05:22.180
T-minus 60 to reverse thrust.

00:05:22.220 --> 00:05:24.010
Set reverse acceleration protection
throughout the ship.

00:05:26.010 --> 00:05:27.590
Ballute standing by.

00:05:27.630 --> 00:05:30.630
Target is breaking away
from the Garuda and climbing.

00:05:30.680 --> 00:05:33.800
Error correction to estimated
contact point, minus 8.

00:05:33.840 --> 00:05:36.800
We are about to scrape
the upper thermosphere

00:05:36.840 --> 00:05:39.050
and pull up the target
via tether cable.

00:05:39.090 --> 00:05:42.260
All hands, don't take your eyes off
the ship's altitude and speed.

00:05:42.300 --> 00:05:45.680
The Garencieres...
The Sleeves' camouflaged freighter.

00:05:46.180 --> 00:05:49.760
That's the ship that's been
shadowing us since Industrial 7.

00:05:49.800 --> 00:05:51.680
Are you sure about this, sir?

00:05:51.720 --> 00:05:55.180
Sure or no, it's a direct order
from Commander Bright.

00:05:55.220 --> 00:05:59.130
Besides, it's nice to have
a job to do.

00:05:59.180 --> 00:06:01.010
Regardless of what that is.

00:06:01.800 --> 00:06:04.680
Target's engine output
appears to have fallen!

00:06:04.720 --> 00:06:06.880
It's deviating from the planned
ascent curve!

00:06:06.930 --> 00:06:07.930
It's what?!

00:06:14.840 --> 00:06:15.840
What's wrong?

00:06:15.880 --> 00:06:18.970
We're having engine trouble!
Output isn't climbing!

00:06:19.010 --> 00:06:20.400
Can't we tough it out?

00:06:20.400 --> 00:06:23.510
We don't have enough fuel to circle the Earth again.

00:06:23.590 --> 00:06:25.340
This is the best she can do!

00:06:26.400 --> 00:06:27.740
Exactly according to plan,

00:06:27.740 --> 00:06:30.890
the ship we have a nasty history with has come to meet us,

00:06:31.010 --> 00:06:33.630
but I guess it was too much
to hope for.

00:06:33.680 --> 00:06:37.800
That ship is acting for neither
the Federation nor Zeon.

00:06:37.840 --> 00:06:40.260
If we could only reach them,
it might open a path for us.

00:06:40.300 --> 00:06:41.550
Maybe so, but...

00:06:52.220 --> 00:06:53.300
Banagher!

00:06:53.340 --> 00:06:55.380
Kwani! Ivan!
What are you doing?!

00:06:57.010 --> 00:07:00.010
Those three are crazy...
Flaste! Can we make it?!

00:07:00.050 --> 00:07:01.340
We're climbing, but we don't have

00:07:01.340 --> 00:07:03.510
enough power to get back onto our old trajectory!

00:07:07.970 --> 00:07:09.840
Can we decrease
our altitude any further?

00:07:09.880 --> 00:07:10.880
This is it, sir!

00:07:10.930 --> 00:07:13.340
All right, fire tether cable!

00:07:13.380 --> 00:07:14.380
Tether, fire!

00:07:28.590 --> 00:07:31.590
Come back to space, Banagher!

00:07:59.430 --> 00:08:00.430
It reached!

00:08:00.470 --> 00:08:01.590
Are we connected?!

00:08:01.630 --> 00:08:03.090
Yes, but not with- -

00:08:10.800 --> 00:08:12.720
Forget it! Your suit will be
ripped apart!

00:08:12.760 --> 00:08:13.800
Banagher!

00:08:44.760 --> 00:08:46.720
What's this light?

00:09:53.510 --> 00:09:54.720
Gundam...

00:10:16.720 --> 00:10:18.050
Who's firing at us?!

00:10:18.090 --> 00:10:21.510
IFF code match found!
It's one of ours!

00:10:21.550 --> 00:10:23.550
Cannon fire confirmed dead ahead
along our trajectory.

00:10:23.590 --> 00:10:25.630
Difference in elevation, 12!
Range, 400!

00:10:25.680 --> 00:10:27.930
Dogosse Giar class!
It's the General Revil!

00:10:28.930 --> 00:10:30.880
Are you sure?

00:10:30.930 --> 00:10:32.550
Positive, sir!

00:10:32.590 --> 00:10:34.970
The General Revil...

00:10:35.010 --> 00:10:36.880
Mobile suits incoming!
Lots of them!

00:10:53.260 --> 00:10:57.130
That thing's a monster!
So this really was a trap?!

00:10:57.180 --> 00:11:01.300
No! The way they're deployed,
they're also targeting the Nahel Argama!

00:11:01.340 --> 00:11:04.180
Their plan is to wipe us all out
at once, huh?

00:11:04.220 --> 00:11:05.720
I don't believe it...!

00:11:06.300 --> 00:11:07.380
You can't!

00:11:12.970 --> 00:11:14.220
We came so close...

00:11:32.680 --> 00:11:34.880
It's the Neo Zeons?!

00:12:02.090 --> 00:12:04.220
The General Revil...

00:12:22.340 --> 00:12:24.380
It would be so easy
to destroy them...

00:12:51.050 --> 00:12:53.840
Just know that this is the only time
we'll pull our punches with you,

00:12:53.880 --> 00:12:55.930
you Federation pipsqueaks!

00:13:40.470 --> 00:13:43.260
Direct beam hit! Impact to starboard
and central superstructures!

00:13:43.300 --> 00:13:45.340
XO, get me a damage report!

00:13:45.380 --> 00:13:48.470
Romeo 104, moderate damage.
Appears to be out of action.

00:13:48.800 --> 00:13:50.130
What the hell is going on?

00:13:50.180 --> 00:13:52.630
It seems to be long-range fire
from an enemy mobile suit!

00:13:52.970 --> 00:13:55.130
Deploy beam dispersal screen!

00:14:11.630 --> 00:14:13.800
Enemy mobile suit
closing in at high speed!

00:14:13.840 --> 00:14:16.680
Beam attenuation rate
down to 86%!

00:14:16.720 --> 00:14:18.590
Matt Team, Alan Team, launch!

00:14:18.630 --> 00:14:19.630
63%!

00:14:19.680 --> 00:14:22.340
No. 5, No. 6, ready to fire!

00:14:22.380 --> 00:14:23.590
42%!

00:14:23.630 --> 00:14:27.470
All hands and all deployed mobile suits,
prepare for barrage!

00:14:27.510 --> 00:14:29.300
27%!

00:14:29.340 --> 00:14:30.380
18%!

00:14:30.430 --> 00:14:33.430
Make your targets
the incoming mobile suit!

00:14:33.470 --> 00:14:35.840
Beam attenuation rate, 12%!

00:14:35.880 --> 00:14:37.050
FIRE!

00:16:07.760 --> 00:16:12.050
The General Revil is altering course.
She appears to be leaving the sector.

00:16:50.090 --> 00:16:55.720
Now we can talk for a while,
key to the Box... Banagher Links.

00:17:12.800 --> 00:17:14.430
Banagher, do you believe?

00:17:16.300 --> 00:17:19.800
That we... the Neo Zeon
and the people of the Federation

00:17:19.840 --> 00:17:21.930
will be able to work together?

00:17:24.130 --> 00:17:26.630
Even once Laplace's Box
is in our reach?

00:17:29.510 --> 00:17:34.430
Banagher, when I was on Earth,
I saw so many things.

00:17:34.470 --> 00:17:37.180
I had known about them,
but it was only when

00:17:37.220 --> 00:17:41.590
I saw, heard, and felt them
in person that I truly understood.

00:17:42.130 --> 00:17:45.300
Just how little I knew
about the world until now.

00:17:46.430 --> 00:17:48.090
It was the same for me.

00:17:48.130 --> 00:17:51.510
On Earth, I saw things,
felt things, and then it hit me.

00:17:51.550 --> 00:17:56.260
Even if people understand each other,
it's not easy for them to work together.

00:17:56.300 --> 00:18:00.130
Humans can't escape from
the obligations they're born into.

00:18:01.050 --> 00:18:04.260
But still, that man, Cardeas Vist,

00:18:04.300 --> 00:18:07.090
wanted Laplace's Box
to be opened anyway.

00:18:11.680 --> 00:18:15.090
I want to believe, too.
In people's good intentions.

00:18:20.430 --> 00:18:23.380
The final coordinates
of Laplace's Box are...

00:18:34.260 --> 00:18:36.720
Object detected!
Ship confirmed! Checking registry!

00:18:36.760 --> 00:18:39.260
No doubt about it, that's the ship
that attacked the Garuda.

00:18:39.300 --> 00:18:41.720
Where have they been hiding out
these past two days?

00:18:41.760 --> 00:18:45.630
Attention, camouflaged Sleeves
freighter. Heave to immediately.

00:18:45.680 --> 00:18:46.680
I say again,

00:18:46.720 --> 00:18:49.300
attention, camouflaged
Sleeves freighter.

00:18:49.340 --> 00:18:50.550
Heave to immediately.

00:18:54.680 --> 00:18:59.470
Attention, camouflaged Sleeves
freighter. Heave to immediately.

00:18:59.510 --> 00:19:01.800
I say again, heave to immediately!

00:19:05.470 --> 00:19:07.680
Get out here, Unicorn!

00:19:07.720 --> 00:19:08.720
Watts!

00:19:12.430 --> 00:19:17.260
Geez, he's still mad over being
kicked into the sea by the Unicorn.

00:19:22.050 --> 00:19:23.090
I'll make them stop!

00:19:42.800 --> 00:19:43.840
It's too quiet.

00:19:47.260 --> 00:19:48.260
Watts!

00:19:48.300 --> 00:19:49.590
Come back!

00:19:49.630 --> 00:19:51.760
Get away from that thing! Hurry!

00:20:01.090 --> 00:20:02.590
Watts... Watts!

00:20:22.220 --> 00:20:23.760
This is your fault.

00:20:23.800 --> 00:20:27.090
You were the one who provided the
Unicorn with the means to escape,

00:20:27.130 --> 00:20:28.720
Capt. Bright.

00:20:28.760 --> 00:20:32.680
You were lured all the way
to the opposite side of the Earth...

00:20:32.720 --> 00:20:35.680
The Nahel Argama
and the Neo Zeon forces

00:20:35.720 --> 00:20:39.260
must be well on their way
to the moon by now.

00:20:39.300 --> 00:20:42.680
I admit that my decision backfired.

00:20:42.720 --> 00:20:47.430
I never anticipated that Full Frontal
would take action so quickly

00:20:47.470 --> 00:20:49.590
and capture the Nahel Argama.

00:20:49.630 --> 00:20:53.750
How did you lose track of a force large
enough to drive off the General Revil?

00:20:54.180 --> 00:20:57.430
Due to the nature of the
General Revil's mission,

00:20:57.470 --> 00:21:01.430
all patrol fleets around Earth
had been withdrawn.

00:21:02.590 --> 00:21:06.550
It would seem that General Staff HQ
was under civilian pressure again.

00:21:08.630 --> 00:21:12.760
Ms. Martha, what is this "Laplace's Box"
that would drive the Neo Zeon

00:21:12.800 --> 00:21:14.760
to such drastic measures?

00:21:17.800 --> 00:21:22.210
Do you know about the tapestry that
has been handed down in the Vist family?

00:21:23.220 --> 00:21:27.590
The chest in it is guarded by
a white unicorn and a black lion.

00:21:28.720 --> 00:21:32.260
If they prove unable to protect it,
we will simply obliterate it.

00:21:32.300 --> 00:21:34.510
The Londo Bell's services
will no longer be required.

00:23:38.220 --> 00:23:41.510
Next time, on Mobile Suit Gundam Unicorn

00:23:41.550 --> 00:23:43.630
THE SIDE CO-PROSPERITY SPHERE

00:23:45.010 --> 00:23:48.470
awaken the Newtype that lies within you.
